&lt;li class="MsoNormal" style="color: black; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;none&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="MsoNormal" style="color: black; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;none&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="MsoNormal" style="color: black; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;Effective December 1, 2025, Robert J. Stefani, Senior Vice President/Chief Financial Officer of the general partner entity, Southwest Gas Corporation, departed the Company.&amp;#160;&lt;font style="font-size: 16.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;"&gt;Upon his departure Justin S. Forsberg assumed the role of Senior Vice President/Chief Financial Officer and Treasurer.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="MsoNormal" style="color: black; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;not applicable&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
