&lt;p class="Normal"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;Note 7: Depreciation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="Normal"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;Depreciation is provided for gas plant in service utilizing the straight-line remaining-life basis at a rate of 2.5% per year.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="Normal"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E. Cash Flows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="Normal"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;Note 8: Cash Flows&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="Normal"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;The payment for the CIAC (investing activity) and gross-up (operating activity) were not remitted to the Company by the end of December 2025, they had no impact on cash flows during year-to-date 2025. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="Normal"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;In the fourth quarter of 2025, there were $1,164,843 non-cash investing activities related to construction activities expended by the general partner, SWG, on behalf of the Company. This activity typically is reflected in the Company&amp;#8217;s plant-related accounts, as well as in Accounts Payable to Associated Companies, but has no direct impact on cash flows.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="Normal"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"&gt;F. Service Agreement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="Normal"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;Note 9: Service Agreement&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="Normal"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;The Company has a month-to-month Service Agreement with Transwestern Pipeline Company, LLC.&lt;font style="mso-spacerun: yes;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/font&gt;The agreement is for the Mojave delivery point between Transwestern Pipeline and the Company, and includes hourly peaking service (HPS). &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
